  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#stormwaterMaterialText">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#CostItem"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label>우수 재질 표현</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>원본 품명/규격에 명시된 우수 재질 표현. 단위나 수치의 추정 변환 없이 보존한다.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#origin">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
