  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#StormwaterInstallationCostItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>우수 설치 비용항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>우수 설치 시공 작업에 대한 비용대상. 작업 활동 자체나 자재 공급 비용은 아니다.</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>researcher_cost_role_bridge</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#CostItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#SummaryItem">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>집계항목</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>계약 또는 기성 상세항목의 금액을 동일 공종별로 합산한 항목</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#DocumentItem"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#ProgressPaymentStatement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>공사기성부분내역서</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>회차별 기성수량과 기성금액을 산정해 제시하는 유일한 산출서류</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#OutputDocument"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#CostCalculationStatement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>원가계산서</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>비용항목의 원가 구성과 산정금액을 제공하는 근거서류</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>seed</tbox:origin>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#EvidenceDocument"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#InstallationMethod">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>InstallationMethod</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>우수 시공 방법</rdfs:comment>
    <tbox:origin>researcher_anchor</tbox:origin>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/kicem/hybrid/civil_stormwater#evidence">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>
